{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOB","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"约伯记","commonName":"约伯记","title":"约伯记","order":18,"numberOfChapters":42,"sha256":"874796c2a3eb73036d71ac9f1a85d305483400ee19fc61db9f76e87d836724b8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":42,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOB/42.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1067},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["撒但再试探约伯"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["又有一天， 神的众子来侍立在耶和华面前，撒但也来在其中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶和华问撒但说：「你从哪里来？」撒但回答说：「我从地上走来走去，往返而来。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华问撒但说：「你曾用心察看我的仆人约伯没有？地上再没有人像他完全正直，敬畏 神，远离恶事。你虽激动我攻击他，无故地毁灭他，他仍然持守他的纯正。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["撒但回答耶和华说：「人以皮代皮，情愿舍去一切所有的，保全性命。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["你且伸手伤他的骨头和他的肉，他必当面弃掉你。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和华对撒但说：「他在你手中，只要存留他的性命。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["于是撒但从耶和华面前退去，击打约伯，使他从脚掌到头顶长毒疮。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["约伯就坐在炉灰中，拿瓦片刮身体。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他的妻子对他说：「你仍然持守你的纯正吗？你弃掉 神，死了吧！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["约伯却对她说：「你说话像愚顽的妇人一样。嗳！难道我们从 神手里得福，不也受祸吗？」在这一切的事上约伯并不以口犯罪。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["三个朋友来安慰约伯"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["约伯的三个朋友—提幔人以利法、书亚人比勒达、拿玛人琐法—听说有这一切的灾祸临到他身上，各人就从本处约会同来，为他悲伤，安慰他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他们远远地举目观看，认不出他来，就放声大哭。各人撕裂外袍，把尘土向天扬起来，落在自己的头上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他们就同他七天七夜坐在地上，一个人也不向他说句话，因为他极其痛苦。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOB/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOB/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JOB/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}